// VALIDATION RULES
// 1. Every player must have name, pos, team, ovr, and source.
// 2. ovr must be 0-99. spd/str/agi/awr/inj must be 0-99.
// 3. pts/reb/ast/stl/blk/tov must be >= 0. fg/tp/ft must be 0-100.
// 4. pos must be one of: PG, SG, SF, PF, C.
// 5. team must be one of the 30 NBA team names.
// 6. xf is optional (null or omitted if no X-factor).
// 7. source must explain how the rating was derived.
// 8. No duplicate players (same name + team).
// 9. Position balance: aim for ~90 players per position (450 total / 5 positions).
// 10. Total players: ~450 (current NBA rosters, ~15 per team).
